ddress与执行计数的选定分支另由OD01–OD07取证，不再列为未取得显示体。"],"stages":{"sourceRecovery":"selected original bodies recovered","runtimeCorroboration":"not-executed","wholeFeatureClosure":"not-established"}},{"id":"DI06","topic":"image","classification":"independent-implementation","from":"当前GrayImage / RgbImage / RawImage构造","to":"拥有托管像素数组，再通过PortValue引用传递","representation":"构造ReadOnlySpan.ToArray；Pixels只读span","cache":"图像构造发生复制；PortValue.Image和连接赋值不再自动复制","release":"这三个图像类无IDisposable，托管数组寿命取决于剩余引用/GC","behavior":"当前三种图像构造复制输入字节。GraphExecutor的nodeInputs[c.ToPort]=v及结果字典复制只复制PortValue引用；ToolDisplayFrame/ImageLayers可继续保留图像引用。不能将ReadonlyDictionary或ReadOnlySpan说成每一层都复制像素，也不能把模块Dispose当作这些托管图像的显式释放。","refs":[{"path":"src/VisionData/ImageGeometry.cs","member":"GrayImage owned constructor","sha256":"0c169c1fe86eb8048fc6b7329d425088c32d2a690535c05962e5276d9907882d","start":4,"end":25,"excerpt":"public sealed class GrayImage:IImageData\n{\n    private readonly byte[] pixels;\n    public int Width { get; }\n    public int Height { get; }\n    public int Stride=>Width;\n    public ImagePixelFormat Format=>ImagePixelFormat.Mono8;\n    public ReadOnlySpan\u003cbyte> Pixels => pixels;\n    public byte this[int x, int y] => pixels[Offset(x, y)];\n    private int Offset(int x, int y)\n    {\n        if ((uint)x >= (uint)Width || (uint)y >= (uint)Height) throw new ArgumentOutOfRangeException();\n        return y * Width + x;\n    }\n    public GrayImage(int width, int height, ReadOnlySpan\u003cbyte> data)\n    {\n        if (width \u003c= 0 || height \u003c= 0) throw new ArgumentOutOfRangeException(nameof(width));\n        if (data.Length != checked(width * height)) throw new ArgumentException(\"Pixel count must equal width * height.\", nameof(data));\n        Width = width; Height = height; pixels = data.ToArray();\n    }\n}\n","evidenceType":"current-source","binaryIdentity":"Current independent implementation, not an original runtime layout."},{"path":"src/VisionData/ColorImage.cs","member":"RGB owned constructor","sha256":"8f2d913e0bfa11edc4c6dd04eef83031b09265a34cc92fac04ca5970c40ba4b6","start":11,"end":23,"excerpt":"public sealed class RgbImage:IImageData {\n readonly byte[] pixels;\n public int Width {get;}\n public int Height {get;}\n public int Stride=>checked(Width*3);\n public ImagePixelFormat Format=>ImagePixelFormat.Rgb24;\n public ReadOnlySpan\u003cbyte> Pixels=>pixels;\n public RgbImage(int width,int height,ReadOnlySpan\u003cbyte> data){\n  if(width\u003c=0||height\u003c=0)throw new ArgumentOutOfRangeException(nameof(width));\n  if(data.Length!=checked(width*height*3))throw new ArgumentException(\"RGB24 data must contain width * height * 3 bytes.\",nameof(data));\n  Width=width;Height=height;pixels=data.ToArray();\n }\n}","evidenceType":"current-source","binaryIdentity":"Current independent implementation, not an original runtime layout."},{"path":"src/VisionData/RawImage.cs","member":"Raw owned constructor","sha256":"e380f1abb06c6f49a8584d37ea8acfd22300ef87fbf66f503c20f3aa0f6f6342","start":4,"end":16,"excerpt":"public sealed class RawImage:IImageData {\n readonly byte[] pixels;\n public int Width{get;}\n public int Height{get;}\n // Zero means that the transport supplied no packed-row stride (for example planar data).\n public int Stride{get;}\n public ImagePixelFormat Format{get;}\n public ReadOnlySpan\u003cbyte> Pixels=>pixels;\n public RawImage(int width,int height,ImagePixelFormat format,ReadOnlySpan\u003cbyte> data,int stride=0){\n  if(width\u003c=0||height\u003c=0||stride\u003c0||data.IsEmpty)throw new ArgumentOutOfRangeException(nameof(width));\n  Width=width;Height=height;Format=format;Stride=stride;pixels=data.ToArray();\n }\n}","evidenceType":"current-source","binaryIdentity":"Current independent implementation, not an original runtime layout."},{"path":"src/VisionFramework/GraphExecutor.cs","member":"Input value reference reuse","sha256":"6fed55fe29e547248cab05a36072e690b76eb9668609f0318b795c24d7628f9c","start":24,"end":24,"excerpt":"